<title>PORTUGAL: Siemens to build condensers in Portugal.</title>
<headline>Siemens to build condensers in Portugal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese unit of German group Siemens plans to invest 10 billion escudos in the next year in a factory in southeast Portugal that will produce condensers for the car industry, a government official said.</p>
<p>&quot;An investment of 10 billion escudos is being negotiated that will create 400 jobs in Evora,&quot; Economy Minister Augusto Mateus told reporters after meeting senior officials from Siemens. He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
